BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cinema Dissect-Off: 28 Days Later
DTSTART:20250510T170000Z
DTEND:20250510T231000Z
DTSTAMP:20250510T170000Z
UID:UvpdY97q7W
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 360 mins (6h00m)\n\nFilm Talks Join Cinema Dissectio
 n masters\, Jeremy Cropf and Dan Doody in our first ever Dissect-Off! Don
 ’t miss the showdown of niche knowledge as we analyze Danny Boyle’s po
 st-apocalyptic horror masterpiece\, 28 Days Later. Listen to your favorite
  cinephiles deep dive into the iconic set pieces of an abandoned London\, 
 examine the star-making turn that brought Cilian Murphy to the masses\, an
 d settle the debate once and for all about where this film sits in the zom
 bie movie canon. Just in time to prepare for 28 Years Later! Join our favo
 rite Cinema Dissection nerds Jeremy Cropf and Dan Doody for a scene-by-sce
 ne breakdown of Danny Boyle’s post-apocalyptic horror masterpiece\, 28 D
 ays Later.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/education/adult-fil
 m-education/film-talks/cinema-dissect-off-28-days-later
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
