BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Manas
DTSTART:20250516T220000Z
DTEND:20250516T235500Z
DTSTAMP:20250516T220000Z
UID:Qi0K2TjqQw
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nSet in a corner of Brazil that r
 emains mostly untouched by the modern world\, this is an earnest and movi
 ng tale of Marcielle\, a young victim of abuse who yearns to find a way ou
 t of a hostile home and a village that has resisted change for generations
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/manas
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Billy
DTSTART:20250517T003000Z
DTEND:20250517T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20250517T003000Z
UID:IsPpKCxmG7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nIn this compassionate yet distur
 bing documentary\, director Lawrence Côté-Collins inspects the life of f
 ormer filmmaking friend Billy Poulin\, now in prison for murder\, through 
 his own stockpile of video footage and deconstructs the effects of untreat
 ed schizophrenia.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/billy
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
