BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:April
DTSTART:20250518T030000Z
DTEND:20250518T052500Z
DTSTAMP:20250518T030000Z
UID:cONmVjaNvy
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 134 mins (2h14m)\n\nAn obstetrician who secretly pro
 vides abortions and other family planning services to a remote village in 
 Eastern Georgia finds herself thrust into the harsh\, investigative spotli
 ght when she loses a newborn while on duty in the unflinching second film 
 from Dea Kulumbegashvili (Beginning).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/apr
 il
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Transfers
DTSTART:20250518T190000Z
DTEND:20250518T204000Z
DTSTAMP:20250518T190000Z
UID:6WcEcrqcaA
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nA poignant documentary that uses 
 testimonials\, archival material\, animations\, and heartbreaking reenactm
 ents to chronicle Argentina’s onetime military dictatorship’s use of t
 he infamous Death Flights\, one of the most brutal and effective ways of k
 illing and disappearing people.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/transfers
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:FutureWave: Teenage Hearts
DTSTART:20250518T211500Z
DTEND:20250518T230500Z
DTSTAMP:20250518T211500Z
UID:EldSQs30G9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 98 mins (1h38m)\n\nThis shorts package explores the 
 messy\, hilarious\, and sometimes tragic journeys of the teenage heart. Th
 ese films made by filmmakers aged 18 and under explore love in all its per
 mutations\, including romantic love\, self-love\, and familial love.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/festival/futurewave-teenage-hearts
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
